This SDK embeds sing-box and adapts its public Go packages and platform
integration interfaces. Upstream source: https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box
Pinned prerelease: v1.15.0-alpha.13 (https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/releases/tag/v1.15.0-alpha.13)

